// Counters and gauges (phase 11).
//
// `metrics_add(name, value)` and `metrics_set(name, value)` write one
// JSON line each to the same sink as `log`:
//
// ```json
// {"ts":1700000000000,"metric":"tasks","kind":"counter","value":3}
// ```
//
// Both are `io` effects, so a `pure fn` cannot record a metric (`E1300`).
// Metrics flush on exit, including on a panic, because each call writes
// immediately rather than buffering.
